#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:83
msgid ""
"Weather for more than 200,000 places, without an API key. There are three "
"ways to add it:"
msgstr "Cuaca untuk lebih daripada 200,000 tempat, tanpa kunci API. Terdapat tiga cara untuk menambahkannya:"

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:86
msgid "Block"
msgstr "Blok"

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:87
msgid ""
"In the editor, add the “Weather Widget Pro” block, search for your city and "
"choose what to show in the block sidebar."
msgstr "Dalam editor, tambahkan blok “Weather Widget Pro”, cari bandar anda dan pilih apa yang hendak dipaparkan dalam bar sisi blok."

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:91
msgid "Widget"
msgstr "Widget"

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:92
msgid ""
"Go to Appearance > Widgets (or the Customizer) and add “Weather Widget Pro” "
"to a sidebar. If your theme has no widget areas, use the block or the "
"shortcode."
msgstr "Pergi ke Penampilan > Widget (atau Penyesuai) dan tambahkan “Weather Widget Pro” pada bar sisi. Jika tema anda tiada kawasan widget, gunakan blok atau kod pendek."

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:94
